    </unit>
    <unit id="howto.heading">
      <segment>
        <source>How it works</source>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="howto.step1">
      <segment>
        <source>Register the MCP server with your coding agent and restart the agent.</source>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="howto.step2">
      <segment>
        <source>Switch the toolbar on: for the backend in User Settings &gt; Agentation, for the frontend in the Agentation section of the Admin Panel.</source>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="howto.step3">
      <segment>
        <source>Open the toolbar, pick an element and write a note. Agentation records the selector, the page and the computed styles.</source>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="howto.step4">
      <segment>
        <source>Your agent reads the annotation over MCP and resolves it against the code.</source>
      </segment>
    </unit>
